---
subject: New report assigned #{{ report_id }}
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>New report assigned</title></head>
<body style="font-family: sans-serif; color: #333;">
  <h1>Hello {{ recipient_name }},</h1>
  <p>A new report has been assigned to you.</p>
  <p><strong>Report:</strong> #{{ report_id }} dated {{ report_date }}</p>
  <p><strong>Assigned to:</strong> {{ assigned_user_name }}</p>
</body>
</html>